    {
      "id": "p0207-b015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The Starfait received this new name and description early in Underta/e's localization, when Toby and the translation team were still getting accustomed to the project's workflow and with working with each other. During this time, Toby explained his vision for the Japanese script:",
        "raw": "The Starfait received this new name and description early in Underta/e's\nlocalization, when Toby and the translation team were still getting accustomed\nto the project's workflow and with working with each other. During this time,\nToby explained his vision for the Japanese script:",
        "status": "corrected",
