    {
      "id": "p0207-b017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "With this note in mind, the team played around with various item names in early versions of the Japanese script. Thus, at some point, the \"Starfait\" became the -t}-/-T'--ij-/·'f'- (sande sande, \"Sunday Sundae\") and remained that way. This \"Sunday Sundae\" change does have drawbacks, however: the new name and description are no longer Metta ton-themed or star-themed.",
        "raw": "With this note in mind, the team played around with various item names\nin early versions of the Japanese script. Thus, at some point, the \"Starfait\"\nbecame the -t}-/-T'--ij-/·'f'- (sande sande, \"Sunday Sundae\") and remained\nthat way. This \"Sunday Sundae\" change does have drawbacks, however: the\nnew name and description are no longer Metta ton-themed or star-themed.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08746022,
          0.82117143,
          0.67560871,
          0.90722143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08533402,
          0.82045714,
          0.70318791,
          0.90829286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          57,
          58,
          59,
          60,
          61
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有了这条说明，团队在早期日语剧本中尝试了各种物品名。于是，Starfait 在某个阶段变成了「サンデーサンデー」（sandē sandē，Sunday Sundae，星期日圣代），并一直沿用下来。但这项改动也有缺点：新名字和说明不再与 Mettaton 或星星有关。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
